、この書物のタイトルを知っている者？","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"46":{"step":[[46,47,""]],"type":1,"name":["十四行诗","","Sonetto","","ソネット","","",""],"head_icon":"506401.png","audio":"610002907","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["教员——请让我来！","","","","はい――先生！","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"47":{"step":[[47,48,""]],"type":1,"name":["玛蒂尔达","","Matilda","","マチルダ","","",""],"head_icon":"507301.png","audio":"610002833","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["教员，让我来，这题、我真的知道——！","","","","先生、わたしわかります！　今度は本当です――！","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"48":{"step":[[48,49,""]],"type":1,"name":["教员","","","","教員","","",""],"head_icon":"506201.png","audio":"610002604","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……","","","","……","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"49":{"step":[[49,50,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"0","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["她的视线落到十四行诗身旁。那张书桌上垒着高高的书墙。","","","","彼女は視線をソネットの傍らに向けた。その机には、山積みの本がたくさんおかれている。","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"50":{"step":[[50,51,""]],"type":1,"name":["教员","","","","教員","","",""],"head_icon":"506201.png","audio":"610002605","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["维尔汀，你知道这个问题的答案吗？","","","","ミス・ヴェルティ、あなたはどうかしら？","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"51":{"step":[[51,52,""]],"type":1,"name":["教员","","","","教員","","",""],"head_icon":"506201.png","audio":"610002606","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["维尔汀？","","","","…ミス・ヴェルティ？","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"52":{"step":[[52,53,""]],"type":1,"name":["教员","","","","教員","","",""],"head_icon":"506201.png","audio":"0","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……","","","","……","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"53":{"step":[[53,54,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"0","bool_1":